# The saved articles (two saved through the core's API, without their pictures): the list, then one opened in the reader;
# Left / Right walk the saved list. Saving from the app: offline.script; the page itself: savedpage.script.
seed pin us-ars-technica
seed refresh
seed save us-ars-technica 1
seed save us-ars-technica 4
seed refresh_on_open off
wait 900
key down
key down
wait 200
expect text "2"
key enter
wait 500
expect state page saved
expect state saved 2
shot 01-saved
check saved
key enter
wait 600
expect state page reader
shot 02-saved-reader
key right
wait 400
expect state reader_idx 1
shot 03-next-saved
key esc
wait 300
expect state page saved
